Mejor lo pensamos mañana.

762
00:45:27,931 --> 00:45:29,316
Debería irme a casa.

763
00:45:30,457 --> 00:45:33,434
Dile a Kristi que... Ya sabes.

764
00:45:33,740 --> 00:45:35,192
Sí, vale.

765
00:45:37,887 --> 00:45:39,091
Eh, Kenny.

766
00:45:40,565 --> 00:45:43,637
